# Setoko Environment Example

Copy this file to `.env` and fill in actual secrets.

```env
# App
NODE_ENV=development
PORT=4000
APP_BASE_URL=http://localhost:4000
FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:3000
DOMAIN_ROOT=checkoutaja.com

# Database
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/setoko
DB_POOL_MIN=2
DB_POOL_MAX=10

# Authentication
JWT_SECRET=replace_with_strong_secret
JWT_EXPIRES_IN=7d

# Midtrans
MIDTRANS_SERVER_KEY=your_midtrans_server_key
MIDtrans_CLIENT_KEY=your_midtrans_client_key
MIDTRANS_IS_PRODUCTION=false
MIDTRANS_ENDPOINT=https://app.sandbox.midtrans.com/snap/v1/transactions

# Storage / CDN
STORAGE_PROVIDER=s3
S3_ENDPOINT=https://s3.example.com
S3_REGION=ap-southeast-1
S3_ACCESS_KEY=your_access_key
S3_SECRET_KEY=your_secret_key
S3_BUCKET=setoko-assets
S3_PUBLIC_URL=https://cdn.example.com

# Cloudflare / DNS
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=your_cloudflare_token
CLOUDFLARE_ZONE_ID=your_zone_id

# Supabase (optional alternative to S3)
SUPABASE_URL=https://xxxxx.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your_service_role_key
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_anon_key

# Monitoring
SENTRY_DSN=https://examplePublicKey@o0.ingest.sentry.io/0

# Push notifications (optional)
FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
FIREBASE_CLIENT_EMAIL=
FIREBASE_PRIVATE_KEY=

# Apple / Google signing (for mobile builds)
APPLE_TEAM_ID=
APPLE_APP_ID=
PLAY_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON_PATH=./secrets/play-service-account.json

# Email / notifications
SMTP_HOST=smtp.example.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=your_email
SMTP_PASSWORD=your_password
FROM_EMAIL=no-reply@checkoutaja.com
```

Notes:
- Never commit real secrets to git.
- For production, use secret manager such as GitHub Actions Secrets, AWS Secrets Manager, or environment injection from hosting provider.
- If using Supabase instead of S3, keep `STORAGE_PROVIDER=supabase` and set the corresponding values accordingly.
